msgid "page.faq.torrents.a6.li2"
msgstr "2. Nou rekomand <a %(a_generate)s>zener</a> ou <a %(a_download)s>telecharg</a> nou bann baz donn ElasticSearch ek MariaDB. Sa bann-la kontien enn mapping pou sak rekord dan Anna’s Archive ar so bann fichiers torrent korespondan (si disponib), anba “torrent_paths” dan ElasticSearch JSON."

